{"id":1272,"level":68,"name":"Мат в один хід: ігрова позиція","group":"Мат","format":35,"description":"<p>In any chess game, you have to be on the lookout for mating opportunities. If you can spot one, you win the game. However, on a crowded chess board, you can easily miss the chance to checkmate the king.</p>  <p>When is Black checkmated?</p>  <ul>  <li>The black king is in check.</li>  <li>The black king cannot move out of check.</li>  <li>Black cannot capture the piece that gives check.</li>  <li>Black cannot block the check with another piece</li>  </ul>  <p>It is checkmate and White wins the game!</p>  <p><strong>What do you have to do?</strong><br />Checkmate your opponent in one move. Just like in a real game there are many pieces on the board.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":43,"examples":[{"fen":"5rk1/2b2ppp/3q4/6NQ/8/7P/5PP1/5RK1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rg1,Rg8][%cal Gh5h7,Gd6h2]} 1. Qxh7# 1-0","text":"<p>Обидва гравці загрожують мату, але білі найшвидші! ферзь атакує короля, і її прикриває кінь.</p>","format":35}],"puzzles":[{"id":59036,"fen":"8/5p2/4kP2/4P3/5K2/r7/8/3R4 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Re6]} 1. Rd6# 1-0","format":35,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":45771,"fen":"b4k2/1q3p1p/5Bp1/8/8/8/5PPP/3R2K1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Re7,Ye8,Yf8,Rg7,Yg8]} 1. Rd8# 1-0","format":35,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":59017,"fen":"5k2/5p1p/5Pp1/p7/3R4/5PP1/6KP/q7 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Gf6,Rf8][%cal Yf6e7,Yf6g7]} 1. Rd8# 1-0","format":35,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":45003,"fen":"5rk1/2b2ppp/3q4/6NQ/8/7P/5PP1/5RK1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yh2]} 1... Qh2# 0-1","format":35,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":59094,"fen":"2r5/7R/pp1pkBp1/3p2P1/3P1K2/2P5/P3b3/8 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Re6]} 1. Re7# 1-0","format":35,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":45018,"fen":"b4k2/1q3p1p/5Bp1/8/8/8/5PPP/3RR1K1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Rg1,Yg2]} 1... Qxg2# 0-1","